# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch output from CI, agents and local debugging.
#
# This used to be an ever-growing list of one-off filenames
# (run_68428401017.log, ci_monitor.log, debug_output.txt, gitlog.txt, ...),
# each added by whatever run happened to produce it. Patterns cover the whole
# class instead, so nothing new has to be added by hand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
# CI log bundles dropped in the repo root (runlogs.zip, joblog.zip, ...)
/*.zip
run-*.txt
run_*.txt
run_*-jobs.json
linux_run_*.txt
cmake_*log*.txt
